":null},{\"id\":308266,\"title\":\"War Dogs\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/mDcPRjZC1bb6LavFU3gwsWdVfCM.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oNoprEND25zXR6Fns8cIZUkuoMc.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2016,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Based on the true story of two young men, David Packouz and Efraim Diveroli, who won a $300 million contract from the Pentagon to arm America's allies in Afghanistan.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Crime\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1242419,\"title\":\"Roofman\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wXDFtcnYtevleGzCmAD2ReQnJ4l.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/E7hhuSZ1U5xymN2Olg2EOr4N4P.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A former Army Ranger and struggling father turns to robbing McDonald’s restaurants by cutting holes in their roofs, earning him the nickname \\\"Roofman.\\\" After escaping prison, he secretly lives inside a Toys “R” Us for six months, surviving undetected while planning his next move. But when he falls for a divorced mom drawn to his undeniable charm, his double life begins to unravel, setting off a compelling and suspenseful game of cat and mouse as his past closes in.\",\"genres\":[\"Crime\",\"Comedy\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":8321,\"title\":\"In Bruges\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/vz3Vd6nfq9YZrVvyYx5RHFaYKV3.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dtGxDOcFssdUUTYBr6M6INXTI1e.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"year\":2008,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Ray and Ken, two hit men, are in Bruges, Belgium, waiting for their next mission. While they are there they have time to think and discuss their previous assignment. When the mission is revealed to Ken, it is not what he expected.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Drama\",\"Crime\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1295400,\"title\":\"The Last Viking\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/cgvGExc0kfHRUffTKBSQHPKchrq.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zo1SfeASCrbHFaXJN9y1RW7uU2m.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After serving fourteen years for robbery, Anker is released from prison and reunites with his mentally ill brother Manfred, who alone knows where the stolen money is hidden but has forgotten its location, sending them on a journey to recover the loot and confront who they are.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Crime\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":9291,\"title\":\"The Longest Yard\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/nbKcVBcxF96ARW2oKHqDYAcLdu.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/63V4wbVah1gnjckPJnSU0ZmOGAW.jpg\",\"rating\":6.7,\"year\":2005,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Disgraced pro football quarterback Paul Crewe lands in a Texas federal penitentiary, where manipulative Warden Hazen recruits him to advise the institution's football team of prison guards. Crewe suggests a tune-up game which lands him quarterbacking a crew of inmates in a game against the guards. Aided by incarcerated ex-NFL coach and player Nate Scarborough, Crewe and his team must overcome not only the bloodthirstiness of the opposition, but also the corrupt warden trying to fix the game against them.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Comedy\",\"Crime\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":337170,\"title\":\"American Made\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/23ILgoPSO5ShKcTZOuiTVfqFAUB.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5TKGbYKEwGrJlHFfTQzaz1FC5AJ.jpg\",\"rating\":6.9,\"year\":2017,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The true story of pilot Barry Seal, who transported contraband for the CIA and the Medellin cartel in the 1980s.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Crime\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":10147,\"title\":\"Bad Santa\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rfClLIyeHqpMofmrPY8DaLe4z9x.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tbmNzJIc7R1MuEweCOThpTzglyx.jpg\",\"rating\":6.6,\"year\":2003,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"You'd better watch out - Willie T. Soke is coming to town, and he doesn't care if you've been naughty or nice. Willie's favorite holiday tradition is to fill his sacks with loot lifted from shopping malls across the country. But this year his plot gets derailed by a wisecracking store detective, a sexy bartender, and a kid who's convinced Willie is the real Santa Claus.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Comedy\",\"Crime\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":2757,\"title\":\"Adaptation.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ffEmHQAiD0m5dEQ6rlsuA9vlllW.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mkjdussWOjts0Se6hEwfTQdwCv2.jpg\",\"rating\":7.3,\"year\":2002,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Charlie Kaufman is a confused L.A. screenwriter overwhelmed by feelings of inadequacy, sexual frustration, self-loathing, and by the screenwriting ambitions of his freeloading twin brother Donald. While struggling to adapt \\\"The Orchid Thief,\\\" by Susan Orlean, Kaufman's life spins from pathetic to bizarre. The lives of Kaufman and Orlean's book become strangely intertwined as each one's search for passion collides with the other's.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Crime\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1574,\"title\":\"Chicago\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/3ED8cWCXY9zkx77Sd0N5qMbsdDP.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/euxYhuuJjChU755u2YHj0ZPjww3.jpg\",\"rating\":7.1,\"year\":2002,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Murderesses Velma Kelly and Roxie Hart find themselves on death row together and fight for the fame that will keep them from the gallows in 1920s Chicago.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Crime\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":601666,\"title\":\"I Care a Lot\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/gKnhEsjNefpKnUdAkn7INzIFLSu.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pA4J371Gk2F47vyGQOWapcsnOzz.jpg\",\"rating\":6.6,\"year\":2021,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A court-appointed legal guardian defrauds her older clients and traps them under her care. But her latest mark comes with some unexpected baggage.\",\"genres\":[\"Crime\",\"Thriller\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":52629,\"title\":\"El Infierno\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ar8BpJ5xAzTIw9bqD9Sra6TjBvw.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bQObbnj0TY2Q1c55w78m1AN6VNX.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"year\":2010,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After being deported back to Mexico, a man has no choice but to join the vicious drug cartel that has corrupted his hometown in order to survive.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Crime\",\"Western\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"1WToR9RDdzw\",\"name\":\"TRAIN STATION: Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}